  "instructions": [
    "Melt 1 tsp of vegetable oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Add 1 tsp of ginger paste and saut\u00176 for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add 2 tsp of dashi-extract and stir to combine.",
    "Add 120g of Colby Jack cheese and stir until melted and smooth.",
    "Add 1 tsp of sesame oil and stir to combine.",
    "Add 1 tsp of salt and 1 tsp of sugar, and stir to combine.",
    "In a small bowl, mix 1 tsp of cornstarch with 120ml of water until smooth.",
    "Add the cornstarch mixture to the pan and stir to combine.",
    "Add 2 pieces of Fujian-style flatbread and cook for 2-3 minutes until crispy.",
    "Transfer the bao to a plate and garnish with green onions."
